        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions Model 8411/72 6 Foot Stainless Steel Door Pull</b>\r\n<p>\r\n6 feet (72 inches) long stainless steel door pull from First Impressions can be used in many applications such as commercial office entry doors,  store front doors, large appliance doors, just about anywhere a large door pull is desired.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-8411-72-pull.jpg?v=1704442274\" width=\"580\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"First Impressions Model 8411/72 6 Foot Stainless Steel Door Pull\">\r\n</p>\r\n<!-- <p>\r\nAlso available in other lengths: <br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/stainless-steel-pioneer-door-pull-first-impressions-pnr150smts4\"><b>24\" Stainless Steel Door Pull</b></a><br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/3-foot-stainless-steel-door-pull-first-impressions-pnr150036smts4\"><b>36\" Stainless Steel Door Pull</b></a><br> \r\n<a href=\"/products/4-foot-long-stainless-steel-pioneer-door-pull-first-impressions-pnr150048smts4\"><b>48\" Stainless Steel Door Pull</b></a><br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/5-foot-long-commercial-door-pull-first-impressions-model-10-60-us32d\"><b>60\" Stainless Steel Door Pull</b></a><br> \r\n<a href=\"/products/6-foot-long-commercial-door-pull-first-impressions-model-10-72-us32d\"><b>72\" Stainless Steel Door Pull</b></a><br> -->\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nLong lasting Satin Stainless Steel door pull with a very clean contemporary design. Available in your choice of Satin Stainless Steel or Polished Stainless Steel. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions Model 8411/72 Stainless Door Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 72\" ( 6' )</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 48\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Diameter: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel or Polished Stainless Steel</b> Pull Handle</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: The First Impressions door pull is available in lengths up to 10 feet and the  Center to Center Mounting distance can be adjusted for your specific application.  Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\"><b>Contact Us</b></a> with your requirements.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged Standard with Thrubolt mounting (Bolts thru the door). Optional Surface mounting or Back to Back mounting available (Pulls bolt to each other - Requires 2 door pulls).\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
